Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗  孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, kids?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了船长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.63,0:00:07.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:07.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了船长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是谁住在深海的大菠萝里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who lives in a pineapple under the sea?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.27,0:00:16.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:16.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.06,0:00:18.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方方黄黄伸缩自如
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:18.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Absorbent and yellow and porous is he
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果四处探险是你的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If nautical nonsense be something you wish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.27,0:00:24.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.03,0:00:26.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就敲敲甲板让大鱼开路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:26.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then drop on the deck and flop like a fish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
