Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:00:56.62,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(175,201.6)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加全套配料的巨无霸至尊蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A King Size Ultra Krabby Supreme with the works
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.62,0:01:03.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裹面糊复炸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:03.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,double batter-fried
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,串在棍上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on a stick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.04,0:01:05.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:05.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,傻子一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle head
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你忘了拿蛋黄酱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You forgot your mayonnaise
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看他们吃那些垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at them eating that garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.46,0:01:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我都要吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're sickening
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我恨蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真好笑  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good one, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.54,0:01:28.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:28.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good what?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞的好像你不知道似的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like you don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Saying
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我恨蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I hate Krabby Patties"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的太搞笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都爱蟹黄堡的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.90,0:01:37.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我不算大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:37.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, not me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.97,0:01:40.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真会讲笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:40.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're good at that
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.43,0:01:41.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:41.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.81,0:01:44.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥说他不喜欢蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:44.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squid says he doesn't like Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好笑了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's really good, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.02,0:01:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笑死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's really funny
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.12,0:01:51.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别跟他们起哄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:51.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't encourage them
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.75,0:01:52.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们会没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:52.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They'll never leave
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just so funny
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要知道我们都说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what we say
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.79,0:02:00.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唯一不喜欢蟹黄堡的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:02:00.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only people who don't like a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.21,0:02:02.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来就没尝过蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:02.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have never tasted one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.13,0:02:03.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我没错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:03.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.97,0:02:05.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:05.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never had one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永远也不会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,never will
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.75,0:02:09.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:09.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.25,0:02:11.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:11.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没吃过蟹黄堡  永远也不会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never had a Krabby Patty, and never will
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.30,0:02:14.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:14.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没吃过蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never had a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.01,0:02:19.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:19.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those words
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.14,0:02:21.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么可能会组成那样一句话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.14,0:02:20.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it possible to use them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in a sentence together like that?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.89,0:02:25.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没吃过蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:25.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never had a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没吃过蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never had a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你现在就得吃一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you've gotta have one right now
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难怪你一直都很悲惨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're always so miserable
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  尝一口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, try this
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把那个垃圾给我拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get that garbage outta my face
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝一下就会爱上的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you try it, you'll love it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.15,0:02:40.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝一口你称之为食物的高辐射混球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try one of those radioactive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sludge balls you call food?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.07,0:02:44.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后你是不是要我跟派大星跳方块舞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:42.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next I suppose you'll want me to go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,square-dancing with Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃嘛  你一定会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're gonna
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.53,0:02:51.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,隧道快打通  火车要进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:51.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Open up the tunnel, here comes the train
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.70,0:02:53.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.33,0:02:56.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你耳朵里面有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:56.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that in your ear?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.00,0:02:56.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:56.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点  嘴巴张大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, open wide
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.17,0:03:01.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  就算我被困到了井底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:01.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, if I were trapped at the bottom of a well
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.46,0:03:02.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,困个三年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:02.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for three years
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有这个蟹黄堡能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with nothing to eat but that Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老子也要先吃我的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd eat my own legs first
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用来走路的腿也吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And not just the extra ones
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这个对你有益
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's good for you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.05,0:03:11.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这叫有益
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:11.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那汉堡就是个热量炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That thing is a heart attack on a bun
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.25,0:03:15.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:15.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I meant
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对你的灵魂有益
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,good for your soul
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得了吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Puh-leez
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我根本没灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no soul
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.43,0:03:28.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好吧  就吃一半
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:28.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, just half
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.55,0:03:30.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:30.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A quarter?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.14,0:03:30.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:30.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One bite?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.89,0:03:34.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闻一闻就行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:34.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just smell it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在外面都不想要这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I didn't want it out there
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.73,0:03:40.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么会在这厕所里对这玩意来食欲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:40.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what makes you think I'd find it more appealing in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托嘛  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.98,0:03:43.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:43.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.11,0:03:46.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃一口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:46.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One bite
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.99,0:03:47.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:47.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你绝对不会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You won't be sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.82,0:03:51.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:51.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.87,0:03:54.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:54.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.87,0:03:56.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你打算要这样下去多久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:56.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how long are you prepared to keep this up?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.84,0:04:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When I die
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别来玷污我的葬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you stay away from my funeral
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道我真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do I really
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.45,0:04:30.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:30.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.32,0:04:34.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个蟹黄堡可能就是最
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:34.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this Krabby Patty may be the most
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Horrible
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Putrid
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做工粗劣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Poorly prepared
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下贱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Vile
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.48,0:04:40.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:40.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unappetizing
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蹩脚的烂三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Disgusting excuse for a sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.31,0:04:48.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让这玩意下肚是我此生最大的不悦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:45.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it has ever been my displeasure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:48.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to have slither down my throat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.43,0:04:48.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:48.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我诅咒这个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I curse this Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有所有喜欢蟹黄堡的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and all who enjoy them
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.27,0:04:57.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁早踏进他们应得的坟里去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:57.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to an early and well-deserved grave
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.04,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(467,392.4)}安息
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是根本没道理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make any sense
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.99,0:05:04.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡绝对是美味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:04.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krabby Patty is an absolute good
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都无法抗拒它美味的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody is immune to its tasty charms
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不算大家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody but me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.62,0:05:12.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样看起来还不确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:12.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does this look unsure to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.92,0:05:14.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:14.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在快去传话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now go spread the word
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Still alive
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.91,0:05:36.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:36.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,浪费了这么多年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All the wasted years
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得再吃点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to have more
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得再吃点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to have more
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.88,0:05:51.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:51.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But wait
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.51,0:05:56.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚给他演那出  他肯定不会放过我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:56.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After that performance, he'd never let me live it down
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.43,0:05:57.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得溜进去偷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:05:57.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta sneak one
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.85,0:05:58.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就偷一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:58.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just one
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.76,0:06:01.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后我就彻底戒掉那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:01.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,then I'm off the stuff for good
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.14,0:06:03.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:03.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it was possible
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.06,0:06:06.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能是真的有人不喜欢蟹黄堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:06.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I guess some people just don't like Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.07,0:06:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来份三层蟹黄堡巨无霸  配海草面包
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need a Triple Krabby Supreme on a kelp bun
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.99,0:06:21.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再多加海腌椰菜然后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:21.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with extra sea pickle and
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后烤焦  行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and burn it to a crisp, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming right up
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你说  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要为之前的所作所为道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to apologize for before
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是想让你高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to make you happy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但现在我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But now I've learned
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各类人都需要得到包容
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's room for all kinds of people
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.34,0:06:43.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不必强求他们都喜欢一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:43.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and they don't all have to like the same things
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要消失啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't go
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我强烈反对你的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,While I strongly disagree with your decision
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.56,0:06:51.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我还是要接受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.56,0:06:51.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I accept it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.43,0:06:55.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要知道  我可不常做这样的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:55.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, it's not often I get to make one like this
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要看人家咬第一口时的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to see the look on their face
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when they take that first bite
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三层蟹黄堡巨无霸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Triple Krabby Supreme
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.62,0:07:04.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三层蟹黄堡巨无霸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:04.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Triple Krabby Supreme
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.58,0:07:07.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁点了三层蟹黄堡巨无霸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:07.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did somebody order a Triple Krabby Supreme?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.75,0:07:08.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定是走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:08.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They must have left
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  要不你就
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, why don't you just uh
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.71,0:07:13.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把它放在这  人家可能会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:13.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,leave it out here in case they come back
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样特别的蟹黄堡得趁新鲜吃  而且
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a patty this special should be eaten fresh and
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.38,0:07:20.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有二十多分钟没吃这宝贝了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,well, I haven't had one of these babies
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:20.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in over 20 minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.39,0:07:20.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:20.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不论点餐的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever they were
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.60,0:07:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,品味都不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they had great taste
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.69,0:07:36.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那位都不知道错过什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:36.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They don't know what they're missing
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回去工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.02,0:07:41.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道要从垃圾堆里翻一个来吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:41.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat one out of the garbage?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真希望我能吃下这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wish I could eat this
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我都要撑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'm so darn full
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh well
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真就垃圾了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had to say garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正也行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but okay
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧  它怎么跑这来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what's this doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个蟹黄堡应该要被火化掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This patty should be cremated
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.81,0:08:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我知道你不喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.81,0:08:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't like him
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你能来参加葬礼  意义十分重大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it means so much that you came
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.17,0:08:52.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我必须要把蟹黄堡弄到手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:52.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have got to get my hands on a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.05,0:08:54.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都拦不住我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:54.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And no one's going to stop me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在那
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it is
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.45,0:09:04.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没人看守
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:04.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,unguarded
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就只要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.94,0:09:08.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  也太简单了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:08.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's too easy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定会有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There must be some kind of
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.91,0:09:11.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,安保措施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:11.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,security?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们蟹堡王的警铃就这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is our burglar alarm?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一桶水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A bucket of water?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was too easy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't water
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汽油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:40.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(375.401,129.808)}蟹黄堡保险库
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy shrimp
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都不知道要从哪开始吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know where to start
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.03,0:09:51.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重点就是只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:51.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that it's just you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,周围空无一人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and nobody
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.41,0:09:53.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:53.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.00,0:09:55.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:55.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都是凌晨三点钟来上班的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I always come to work at 3:00 am
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在这个点来数芝麻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is when I count the sesame seeds
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你又来这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我忘拿我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I forgot my
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡保险库干嘛开着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why is the patty vault open?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.81,0:10:10.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:10.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought that
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.52,0:10:12.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛把一个蟹黄堡藏在背后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:12.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why are you holding a patty behind your back?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我我我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I-I-
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没有藏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't do
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.07,0:10:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why are you acting so nervous?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛出这么多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why are you sweating so much?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛看着这么饿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why do you look so hungry?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.57,0:10:19.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:19.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's not what you think
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这  这可是个天大的误会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Th-this is a big misunderstanding
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got to believe me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.12,0:10:27.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:27.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好  我跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, I am telling you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好给我听好了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better listen to me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.17,0:10:34.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你喜欢蟹黄堡  对不对章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:34.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You like Krabby Patties, don't you, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.97,0:10:38.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:38.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.43,0:10:40.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我承认了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:40.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I admit it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.26,0:10:43.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:43.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it all along, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.81,0:10:49.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有谁能抵挡得住蟹黄堡的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:49.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can resist a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你吃多少了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, how many are you eating?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.77,0:11:01.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:01.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.99,0:11:14.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  不能一口气把蟹黄堡都吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:14.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you can't eat all those patties at one time
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.66,0:11:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.58,0:11:18.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:18.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会爆炸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna blow up?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会更惨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, worse
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡会先跑你大腿里面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it'll go right to your thighs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大腿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My thighs?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后再爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then you'll blow up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.51,0:11:38.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还记得我吃的第一个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:38.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I remember my first Krabby Patty
